{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromfile", "label": "getFromFile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "label": "getFromDirectory", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfrombrowseabledirectory", "label": "getFromBrowseableDirectory", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Enable browse only for internal tools \u2014 a public listing exposes the directory structure."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_staticfilesoptions", "label": "StaticFilesOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-route code only, with no HOCON layer, because an HTTP handler has no ActorSystem at request time \u2014 unlike the WebSocket policy."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_path_traversal_defence", "label": "Path-traversal defence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The URL remainder is fully decoded before validation (peeling every encoding layer), then every segment is rejected if it is .., empty, a NUL, a backslash or a colon segment (Windows drive / NTFS alternate data stream); absolute forms are refused and the joined path is confined to the root."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_symlink_confinement", "label": "symlinks: within-root confinement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checked on every filesystem hop a request touches, not just the resolved path: a directory index file and each listing entry are canonicalised too, so an escaping link is a 404 whether asked for directly or reached as index.html, and it is left out of the listing entirely \u2014 its name, size and mtime are exactly what the policy withholds."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_dotfiles_deny", "label": "dotfiles: deny", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_uniform_404", "label": "Every rejection is a uniform 404", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No information leak about what exists \u2014 the response never distinguishes a denied dotfile, an escaping symlink and a missing file."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_conditional_requests", "label": "Conditional requests (weak ETag, Last-Modified)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_range_requests", "label": "Range requests (206 / 416)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only the requested window is read, never the whole file \u2014 a bytes=0-0 on a 50 MiB file costs one byte."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_contenttypefor", "label": "contentTypeFor(pathOrExt, overrides?)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_streamthreshold", "label": "streamThreshold", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Setting it retires the 413 without losing a bound: it must be at or below maxFileSize, so nothing can buffer past the threshold and the cap becomes unreachable rather than waived. Content-Length is stated by the handler because a backend has nothing to measure on a stream."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_maxfilesize", "label": "maxFileSize (50 MiB, buffered bodies)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_stream_middleware_incompatibility", "label": "Streamed bodies break cached() and idempotent()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both serialise a body by checking for Uint8Array, so a streamed response is stored as an empty object and the second hit serves nothing (#674); and the Express backend pipes a stream with no error handler, so a mid-response failure takes the process or the request with it (#979). Streaming being opt-in is why the out-of-the-box static route is unaffected."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_staticfilesoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfrombrowseabledirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_path_traversal_defence", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_path_traversal_defence", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_symlink_confinement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_path_traversal_defence", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_uniform_404", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_dotfiles_deny", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_uniform_404", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_staticfilesoptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_maxfilesize", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_streamthreshold", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_maxfilesize", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_streamthreshold", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_stream_middleware_incompatibility", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_stream_middleware_incompatibility", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_middleware_idempotency_key_idempotent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_contenttypefor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_conditional_requests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_getfromdirectory", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_range_requests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_uniform_404", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_middleware_idempotency_key_key_validation", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_http_static_files_streamthreshold", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_http_marshalling_streaming_responses", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/http/static-files.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}